    "traits": "• You like to lead and motivate othersn  • You have a growth mindset and a desire to learnn  • You are resilient and handle rejection with easen  • You are outgoing and enjoy building relationshipsn  • You are strategic and proactive in your approachn  • You are self• aware and open to feedbackn  • You are adaptable to changing environments and technologiesn  • You are empathetic and an active listener",
