    "careerGrowth": "Mental Health Counselor ? Licensed Mental Health Counselor (LMHC) ? Private Practice Owner or Clinical Director",
    "workLocation": "Places of Work: Mental health centers, community health centers, private practices, hospitals, schools, prisons, and residential treatment facilities.nnWork Environment: You will typically work indoors in office settings, though some travel may be required to visit patients. The atmosphere can be emotionally intense and demanding, often involving high levels of social interaction with patients and multidisciplinary teams. Most positions are full• time and may require evening or weekend hours in inpatient settings.",
