    "workLocation": "Places of Work: Private Offices, Studios, On• Field, Outdoors, On• Location (may include travel to different countries). Work Environment: Video producers typically work in office settings for planning, scriptwriting, and administrative tasks. During production, they work in studios or at various indoor/outdoor locations. Post• production work is often conducted in editing suites or music studios. The environment is creative and fast• paced, often requiring long or unusual hours (nights and weekends) and physical activities like bending, stooping, and lifting equipment up to 50 pounds.",
    "studyLocation": "GOVERNMENT INSTITUTES  • Indian Institute of Technology, Chennai, Tamil Nadun  • Indian Institute of Technology, Kanpur, Uttar Pradeshn  • Indian Institute of Technology, Guwahati, Assamn  • Periyar University, Palkalai Nagar, Tamil Nadun  • Indian Institute of Technology, Jodhpur, Rajasthann  • International Institute of Information Technology, Bhubaneswar, Odishan  • Indian Institute of Technology, Roorkee, UttarakhandPRIVATE INSTITUTES  • NorthCap University, Gurugram, Haryanan  • Chandigarh University, Chandigarhn  • Presidency University, Bengaluru, Karnatakan  • Chitkara University, Baddi, Himachal Pradeshn  • Lingaya's Vidyyapeeth, Faridabad, Haryanan  • Birla Institute of Technology & Science, Pilani, Rajasthann  • American Film Instituten  • Boston University College of Communicationn  • Chapman University's Dodge College of Film and Media Artsn  • Columbia University Film Schooln  • Florida State University College of Motion Picture Artsn  • Full Sail Universityn  • Los Angeles Film Schooln  • Loyola Marymount University School of Film and Televisionn  • Motion Picture Institute of Michigann  • The New School for Public Engagementn  • New York Film Academyn  • NYU/Tisch School of the Artsn  • San Diego State University School of Theater, Television and Filmn  • School of Visual Artsn  • Seattle Film Instituten  • UCLA School of Theater, Film and Televisionn  • USC School of Cinematic ArtsDISTANCE LEARNING / ONLINE  • Indira Gandhi National Open University (IGNOU)n  • Full Sail University Onlinen  • LA Film School Onlinen  • New York Film Academy Onlinen  • American Film Institute Onlinen  • University of Colorado Boulder (via Coursera)n  • Skillshare",
