    "careerGrowth": "Research Assistant ? Postdoctoral Fellow ? Senior Researcher ? Research Lead ? Head of Organization or AI Safety Field• Building Lead",
    "workLocation": "Places of Work: AI companies, research labs, universities, and non• profits.nWork Environment: Primarily office• based (private offices or open research environments), compute environments, and laboratories.nGeographic Concentration: San Francisco Bay Area, London, Oxford, New York, Pittsburgh, Boston, Geneva, and Singapore.nRemote Options: Remote and hybrid work are increasingly common at many research labs and organizations.",
