    "scholarships": "• Paller Cybersecurity Scholarship: A fully funded international scholarship for non• U.S. citizens to earn credentials at the SANS Technology Institute.n  • EC• Council CCT Scholarship: Provides funding for a Cybersecurity Technician course and certification resources, covering instruction, labs, and courseware.n  • Certified Cyber Security Professional (CCSP) Development Scholarship: Offers up to 100 percent coverage for training fees, including courses like Certified Kali Linux Pen Tester.n  • Petronella Cybersecurity Scholarship: A $1,200 award for students worldwide who submit a PowerPoint presentation on cybersecurity topics like penetration testing.n  • WiCyS Security Training Scholarship: A multi• tiered program for WiCyS members providing skills development and a pathway to cybersecurity careers.n  • BRAIN Offensive Security Academy: Free scholarships for underrepresented communities focusing on offensive security training.n  • Red Team Training Program: An 18• month scholarship for offensive security that provides hands• on training and up to seven industry certifications.n  • ISC2 Cybersecurity Scholarships: Various undergraduate and graduate scholarships for students pursuing degrees in cybersecurity or information assurance.",
    "educationPath": "1.  Complete 10+2 with a focus on Computer Science, Mathematics, and Engineering.n2.  Earn a Bachelor's degree in Computer Science, Cybersecurity, Information Technology, or a related STEM field.n3.  Gain 1• 4 years of hands• on IT experience in roles such as system administration, network engineering, or software development to build a technical foundation.n4.  Obtain industry• standard certifications such as CompTIA Security+, Certified Ethical Hacker (CEH), or Offensive Security Certified Professional (OSCP).n5.  Build a portfolio by participating in hackathons, bug bounty programs, and practicing in legal lab environments like Hack The Box.n6.  Optionally, pursue a Master's degree in Cybersecurity or Information Security to increase competitiveness for senior or lead roles.",
