    "careerGrowth": "Junior Security Tester or SOC Analyst ? Penetration Tester or Ethical Hacker ? Senior Penetration Tester or Red Team Lead ? Security Architect or Information Security Manager ? Chief Information Security Officer (CISO) or CEO",
    "workLocation": "Places of Work: Private Offices, Specialist Security Firms, In• house IT Departments, Remote Work.nnWork Environment: You will typically work in a traditional office setting, but remote and hybrid work arrangements are very common. Many penetration testers operate from home. The work environment varies significantly depending on the organization, industry, and specific project. You may work as part of an internal team, for a specialist consultancy, or as a freelancer. While a standard 37• hour workweek is typical, flexible hours and occasional work outside the 9• to• 5 schedule may be required. Opportunities for global remote work and short• term contracts exist in this field.",
