    "workLocation": "Places of Work: Private Offices, Educational Institutions, Government Agencies, Healthcare Facilities. Work Environment: You will primarily work in office settings or remotely. You may spend time at various worksites, both indoors and outdoors, to conduct facility inspections or audit digital infrastructure. Opportunities for differently abled exist in this field.",
    "studyLocation": "Government Institutes1.  Central Washington University, Ellensburg, Washingtonn2.  DePaul University, Chicago, Illinoisn3.  Georgia Institute of Technology, Atlanta, Georgian4.  University of Illinois Urbana• Champaign, Illinoisn5.  University of South Australia, Adelaide, Australian6.  University of Wisconsin• Milwaukee, Wisconsinn7.  University of Washington, Seattle, WashingtonPrivate Institutes and Organizations1.  Deque University (Online)n2.  WebAIM (Online)n3.  International Association of Accessibility Professionals (IAAP)n4.  Coursera (Partnered with various universities)n5.  Udacity (Partnered with Google)n6.  Scrimba (Online)n7.  Board Infinity (Online)n8.  Mohawk College, Hamilton, Ontarion9.  OCAD University, Toronto, Ontarion10. Toronto Metropolitan University (formerly Ryerson University), Toronto, OntarioDistance Learning / Online1.  W3Cx (via edX)n2.  Udemyn3.  U.S. Department of Homeland Security (Trusted Tester Program)n4.  US Institute of Diplomacy and Human Rights (USIDHR)",
