    "studyLocation": "Study locations for an SEM/PPC Specialist include:nnGOVERNMENT INSTITUTES  • Indian Institute of Technology, Chennai, Tamil Nadun  • Indian Institute of Technology, Kanpur, Uttar Pradeshn  • Indian Institute of Technology, Guwahati, Assamn  • Periyar University, Palkalai Nagar, Tamil Nadun  • Indian Institute of Technology, Jodhpur, Rajasthann  • International Institute of Information Technology, Bhubaneswar, Odishan  • Indian Institute of Technology, Roorkee, UttarakhandPRIVATE INSTITUTES  • NorthCap University, Gurugram, Haryanan  • Chandigarh University, Chandigarhn  • Presidency University, Bengaluru, Karnatakan  • Chitkara University, Baddi, Himachal Pradeshn  • Lingaya's Vidyyapeeth, Faridabad, Haryanan  • Birla Institute of Technology & Science, Pilani, RajasthanDISTANCE LEARNING INSTITUTE  • Indira Gandhi National Open University (IGNOU)",
