    "careerGrowth": "Affiliate (0• 100 avg viewers) • > Partner (100• 1k viewers) • > Established Streamer (1k• 10k viewers) • > Top Streamer (10k+ viewers)",
    "workLocation": "Places of Work: Private Home, Professional Studio, or Esports Facility. Work Environment: Typically a home• based office or dedicated gaming room that is calm and quiet. You will spend long hours indoors, often sitting at a desk and looking at screens. Some professionals may travel to events, tournaments, or conventions. Opportunities for remote work are standard.",
