    "careerGrowth": "Entry/Junior Analyst (0• 2 years) • Analyst (2• 5 years) • Senior Analyst (5• 8 years) • Principal Analyst/Manager (8• 12 years) • Head/Director (10+ years) • Chief Sustainability Officer/ESG Director",
