    "careerGrowth": "Analyst or Associate • Wealth Manager • Senior Wealth Manager • Team Lead or Director • Chief Investment Officer or Partner",
    "workLocation": "Places of Work: Private Offices, Banks, Investment Firms, Insurance Companies, Family Offices, Government Agencies. Work Environment: You will typically work in fast• paced, professional office settings, ranging from small boutique firms to large financial institutions. The role is relationship• driven and client• facing, often requiring travel to meet clients in their homes, offices, or social settings like restaurants. The environment is high• pressure and detail• oriented, especially during market fluctuations. While many maintain a standard business schedule, you may need to work evenings or weekends to accommodate client needs or respond to market crises. Opportunities for remote work or independent practice exist for experienced professionals.",
