    "traits": "• You like to analyze and interpret informationn  • You are detail• oriented and precisen  • You like to solve complex problemsn  • You enjoy leading and coordinating teamsn  • You are comfortable working under pressure and tight deadlinesn  • You are thorough and value high• quality workn  • You enjoy continuous learning and adapting to new technologiesn  • You are an analytical and critical thinker",
