    "scholarships": "• ASCRT Scholarship: Supports students entering or at the early stages of their clinical research careers to access education and training.n  • ACRP Clinical Research Leadership Scholarship: Awarded to students enrolled in a clinical research master's degree program. Provides $5,000 to advance clinical research careers.n  • ACRP Certification Scholarship: Provides $1,200 to cover application, exam, and preparation fees for ACRP certifications (ACRP• CP, CCRA, CCRC, or CPI).n  • HIMSS Foundation Scholarship: Available for students pursuing careers in health information and technology or related fields.n  • Clinical Research Training Scholarship: Funded by the American Academy of Neurology to support clinical research training in the neurosciences.n  • CDS Pathbreaker Scholarship: Supports talented students in Master of Science in Data Science programs, covering full tuition.n  • SMART Scholarship: Provides $25,000–$38,000 for undergraduate or graduate degrees in STEM fields, including clinical data management applications, with a post• graduation employment commitment.",
    "educationPath": "1.  Earn a Bachelor's degree in Life Sciences (Biology, Pharmacology, Microbiology), Pharmacy, Computer Science, Statistics, or Information Technology.n2.  Complete 10+2 in the Science stream as a prerequisite for these undergraduate programs.n3.  Obtain Good Clinical Practice (GCP) certification, which is a key credential for entry into the field.n4.  Gain practical experience through internships or entry• level roles such as Clinical Data Coordinator, Data Entry Specialist, or Clinical Research Assistant.n5.  Consider a Master's degree in Life Sciences, Pharmacy, Computer Science, or a Graduate Certificate in Clinical Data Management for career advancement.n6.  Pursue professional certifications like the Certified Clinical Data Manager (CCDM) from the Society for Clinical Data Management after gaining relevant work experience.n7.  Develop technical proficiency in Electronic Data Capture (EDC) systems (e.g., Medidata Rave, Oracle Clinical) and CDISC standards (SDTM, ADaM).n8.  Utilize resources like Vidyalakshmi (www.vidyalakshmi.co.in) for education loans or the National Scholarship Portal (www.scholarships.gov.in) for financial assistance.",
