    "careerGrowth": "Clinical Data Coordinator • Clinical Data Manager • Senior Clinical Data Manager • Clinical Data Management Director • VP of Data Management",
    "workLocation": "Places of Work: Clinical Research Organizations (CROs), pharmaceutical/biotech companies, medical device companies, hospitals, academia, and government settings.nWork Environment: Typically office• based or laboratory settings. Remote and hybrid work arrangements are very common, though some travel or on• site presence may be required for milestones, inspections, or client meetings. The role involves high levels of virtual collaboration.",
    "studyLocation": "Clinical data managers work in hospitals, pharmaceutical companies, government agencies, private practices, and contract research organizations. Online training and certification programs are available from providers such as Pro Career (Parker, CO), Sprint Info (Fairfax, VA), Spark Software Solutions (San Antonio, TX), and MAXTECH IT SOLUTIONS (Irving, TX).",
