    "careerGrowth": "Research Associate or Data Analyst • Senior Analyst • Bioinformatics Specialist • Clinical Bioinformatics Director • Consultant Clinical Scientist • Laboratory Director or Head of Department • Head of Company/CEO",
    "workLocation": "Places of Work: Research laboratories, clinics, hospitals, universities, pharmaceutical companies, biotechnology firms, and government agencies.nnWork Environment: You will typically work in an office or laboratory setting, with most tasks performed at a computer workstation. The environment is often collaborative, involving interactions with scientists, clinicians, and IT professionals. While most work is computer• based and can sometimes be done remotely, you may spend time in a variety of research or clinical settings. The role is intellectually demanding and may require long hours to meet project deadlines, but it is generally not physically strenuous.",
