    "careerGrowth": "Research Assistant / Lab Technician > Research Associate > Scientist > Senior Scientist > Principal Scientist > VP of Research / CSO",
    "workLocation": "Places of Work: Laboratories, Private Offices, On• Field, Agricultural settings. Work Environment: You will primarily work in laboratory settings and offices, though some roles involve gathering samples in the field. Depending on the specialization, you may travel to agricultural sites, clinical sites, or attend conferences and meetings. You will typically work as part of a multidisciplinary team in environments ranging from small startups to large pharmaceutical companies. Opportunities for differently abled individuals exist in this field.",
