    "workLocation": "Places of Work: Private Offices, Laboratories, Research Institutions, Technology Companies, Universities.nnWork Environment: You will primarily work in indoor laboratory and office settings. You may spend time in specialized cleanrooms for hardware fabrication or cryogenic facilities for testing quantum devices. Your role involves collaborating with interdisciplinary teams of scientists and engineers to design, simulate, and build quantum systems.nnOpportunities for differently abled exist in this field.",
