    "scholarships": "• Marketplace Risk Scholarship Program: Provides complimentary and discounted registration fees for founders or employees of bootstrapped and unfunded startups in the marketplace, sharing, gig, on• demand, and collaborative economy to attend the Marketplace Risk New York Conference.n  • Advantage Solutions Better Together Education Foundation Scholarship: Provides educational funding and support for employees of Advantage Solutions and their families.n  • Digital Marketing Women Employability and Entrepreneurship Program: Offers 100% funded scholarships for women aged 20• 35 to learn digital marketing skills, including social media management and optimization, with zero tuition fees.",
