    "scholarships": "• True North Scholarship: Offered by Bain & Company for women in their penultimate year of undergraduate studies. Winners receive INR 75,000 and an interview for an associate consultant position.n  • AlixPartners MBA Scholarship for Achievement: Provides up to $20,000 and a consulting internship for women and underrepresented MBA students.n  • JumpStart MBA Scholarship: A partnership with AlixPartners offering a $20,000 scholarship and a path to a management consulting internship.n  • Fabian Specht Future Revenue Innovator Scholarship: Awarded by IDeaS to EHL students pursuing revenue management education, with an annual award of €18,000.n  • National Black MBA Association Graduate Case Competition: Offers consulting teams the chance to compete for $50,000 in cash prizes.",
