    "scholarships": "• ICF Foundation Scholarship: Provides tuition for Level 1 (60+ hours) ICF• accredited coaching education, a complimentary one• year ICF membership, and a waived application fee for the ACC credential.n  • The Coach Training Academy Scholarship: Offers partial tuition assistance for life coach training programs to individuals with limited financial resources, reducing total costs and monthly payments.n  • iNLP Center Coach Training Scholarship: Awards scholarships ranging from $500 to $1500 for students in need, applicable to various coach training tracks.n  • Coach U Scholarship Program: Provides financial assistance for the Phase 1 Core Essentials Program to aspiring coaches committed to community impact and diversity.n  • Inner Glow Circle ICF Path Scholarship: Covers full tuition for a Level 1 ICF• accredited program, including ICF membership, waived ACC credential fees, and mentor coaching.n  • Wellcoaches Coaching Scholarship: Includes full tuition for Modules 1• 3, mentoring sessions, and training manuals for underrepresented students and those from economically disadvantaged backgrounds.n  • Frederic Hudson Scholarship Program: Offers partially or fully funded tuition for the Hudson Coach Certification program and 10 hours of coaching to support those with significant financial need.n  • CCI Pay• It• Forward Coaching Scholarship: Provides 10 hours of free life coaching from accredited coaches, with recipients encouraged to volunteer or help others in return.n  • Wayfinder Life Coach Training Financial Awards: Offers a limited number of financial awards for individuals enrolling in their life coach training program.",
